. Also add the opt-in zsh-history backfill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared renderers and the `sase footprint` report commands[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli_report[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fold_status, queries[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli_report: build the shared Rich render layer (heat strips, tiles, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, evidence card, evidence sentence) and add `sase footprint list`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`show`, and `decide` in rich, JSON, and agent-ready Markdown.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Statistics view 09 Footprint (map, lenses, drill-down)[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui_view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tui_recording, cli_report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui_view: register Statistics view 09 with lenses as groupings, an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]interactive row list with area drill-down, the trust header and tiles, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actor and range cycling, honest empty and preview states, keymaps, help,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Evidence card panel and feature finder[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui_card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tui_view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui_card: add the responsive evidence card beside or below the list [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](debounced), the area summary card, the `/` feature finder modal, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy-id, and their goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  11 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decide picker, finish review, and the[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]review_loop[dim] · [dim][/dim]after 